### Cursor Pagination (Recommended)

```http
GET /users?limit=20&cursor=eyJpZCI6MTIzfQ==

Response:
{
  "data": [...],
  "pagination": {
    "next_cursor": "eyJpZCI6MTQzfQ==",
    "has_more": true
  }
}
```

**Benefits:** Fast, consistent results, works with real-time data

